WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.290
Tomobiki High School

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.540
Oh good heavens.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.130
Attending Parents' Day is
so bad for my nerves.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:12.750
I couldn't convince my husband
to come instead,

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.330
which means I have to suffer through
another awful humiliation

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.040
because of that dang Ataru!

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:18.330
Here!
My word, look at that child reading comics!

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:19.290
Pick me!
My word, look at that child reading comics!

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:20.420
I can answer!
My word, look at that child reading comics!

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.670
Well, whatever.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:25.290
I'll just pretend I'm someone else
that's not related to him.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:26.040
Oh! Good day...
I'll just pretend I'm someone else
that's not related to him.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:26.420
Oh! Good day...
Fortunately, there should not be anyone
who knows me in his new class.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:28.880
You're Ataru's mother, right?
Fortunately, there should not be anyone
who knows me in his new class.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:29.500
You're Ataru's mother, right?

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:29.750
KERSNAP!

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:31.500
Would you care to go together?

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.750
Oh, hello!

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.420
I see that you know who I am,
but who are you...?

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:38.750
Have you forgotten?
I'm Shinobu's mother!

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.380
Someone does know me...

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:45.290
I heard that their homeroom teacher
is out sick today.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:48.880
I just hope nothing goes wildly wrong...

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:57.750
BWAMOOMOOOOOO!

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:01.420
W-wow, someone came in an oxcart!

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:05.290
Well, they must surely have nothing to do with us!

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:09.830
Milady. We have arrived at the school.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:16.880
Such a gaudy way to travel...

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:17.670
Who on earth could it be?

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:19.130
Hold on!
Who on earth could it be?

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:22.380
Animals aren't allowed on school grounds.

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:23.710
Keep your mouth shut.

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:25.580
Do you have any idea
who you're dealing with?

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:28.000
Pardon, miss.
Have we met somewhere before?

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.500
Y-you boorish oaf!

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:32.170
A man of your stature
may not address her directly!

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:33.830
Why the heck not?

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:35.380
I don't understand what's going on...

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:35.920
WHRR

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:37.290
You're talking to...

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:38.920
WHRR

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:39.880
...so have some respect!

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.210
Huh?! What'd you say?!

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:43.000
Like I just said!

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.880
WHRR

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:46.040
...have some respect!

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.460
What?! I can't hear you!

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:49.130
KAFOOOOOM!

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:54.540
D-do you suppose that's a spaceship?

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:56.540
Well, it must surely have
nothing to do with us!

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:58.960
What just happened?

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:05.290
MILAAAAADY!

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:10.330
Ah, ah, oheo, ah, eh, ah, eh, oh

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:16.170
Ah, ah, oheo, ah, eh, ah, eh, oh

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:21.580
Nee, sono kimi wa sa

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:25.290
Watashi ni chotto kyomi nai no? Ah, sou

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:27.250
Jaa iikara

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:31.170
Wasurete iya yappari wasurenaide

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:33.130
Ah, mou doushite

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:36.210
Konna ni kimi oshi nanoni

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:40.960
Kizukarenai honto modokashii wa

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.210
Eh, sonna

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:44.920
Kiitenai tte shiranai tte

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:49.170
Watashi zenbu zenbu o wakatteitai no dame dayotte?

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:52.130
Sonna koto iwaretemo

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:53.540
Imi wakannai jan!

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:56.330
Fukakai genshou ijou joushou

00:02:56.330 --> 00:03:00.500
Doko ga ii no nante yoku kikareru kedo sa

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:04.290
Wakaranai de ii yo

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:09.630
Ai de aufrete afurete ah furete tamaranai dake

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.290
Ah, ah, oheo, ah, eh, ah, eh, oh

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:13.710
Wakaranai yo kore nandarou

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.250
Nante setsumei shiyou

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.920
Ah, ah, oheo, ah, eh, ah, eh, oh

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:21.170
Toriaezu watashi dake miteteyo nee!

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:23.420
Ah, ah, oheo, ah, eh, ah, eh, oh

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:26.040
Kokoro kyoro kyoro yurusanai

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.670
Isshun demo ichibyou demo

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:31.710
Sowasowa shiteitai

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:34.630
Dakara issho ni ite

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:42.710
Oh milady...

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:46.290
I'm so relieved to know you're okay!

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.540
Parents' Day Horrors

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:06.750
Is it just me or are they looking this way?

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:08.170
I'm not really sure...

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:13.580
The alien has landed!

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:23.790
Huh?

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:25.540
So, is this a friend of yours or what?

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:26.670
I have no idea who she is!

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:30.500
Is this another one of Ataru's girlfriends...?

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:31.880
She clearly knows you.
Is this another one of Ataru's girlfriends...?

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:34.830
Although, she seems a little too mature for that.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.830
Then again, I wouldn't put anything past him...

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.250
HEEEEY!

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.750
YOU RUDE LOT!

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:43.210
This is the matron of the great
Mendo household over here!

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:44.500
Show some respect already!

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:56.830
Mumble, mumble, mumble...

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:58.040
Okay!

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:01.790
Listen up, commoners.

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:03.040
Milady has a bone to pick with you
about her oxcart...

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:04.290
Hi, Mommy!
Milady has a bone to pick with you
about her oxcart...

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.040
It's been forever!

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.250
Oh, Lum!

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:10.710
Wow, so that's what Lum's mom looks like!

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:12.540
I'm so happy you came!
She's just as much of a knockout as Lum is!

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:13.750
She's just as much of a knockout as Lum is!

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:15.630
Thank god.

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:18.830
I wasn't sure how I should react if she
turned out to be Ataru's girlfriend...

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.830
What a surprise to see you, Mother!

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:23.210
You've been gone for the last 3 days or so.

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:24.920
Oh, Young Master!

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.420
Your mother was very keen on coming

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:30.460
and actually travelled for 3 days
straight to get here by oxcart.

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:34.170
I really don't understand how Mother's
distrust of machines runs so deep.

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.960
By the way, how did this turn into such a circus?

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:39.420
I'm so glad that you asked, sir!

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:42.670
It's all because of that rabble rouser
of a woman over there!

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:45.000
That beautiful lady? Really?

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:47.290
You see, every time I try to speak,
I get rudely interrupted...

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:48.630
What is it, Mother?
You see, every time I try to speak,
I get rudely interrupted...

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:52.080
Um, Young Master!

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:54.460
Please listen! All I've been trying to do...

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:57.170
WHAAAT?! You want me to complain to her?!
is relay milady's words to the crowd...

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.830
as per my duty.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.580
Now even the Young Master
is talking over my lines!

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:05.080
This is just blatantly ridiculous!

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.540
QUIT TALKING!
This is just blatantly ridiculous!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:09.040
So tell me, how is Ten doing?

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:10.040
Miss Lum.

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:13.000
Would you mind interpreting for me?

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:15.580
Mumble, mumble, mumble...

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:17.880
"I do not appreciate you destroying my oxcart."

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:18.790
Okay!

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:22.710
I do so appreciate you destroying that oxcart.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:24.500
Mumble, mumble, mumble...

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:27.670
"You have caused grave offense
and insulted my honor."

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:31.920
You have saved me from being a goner.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:34.170
"I will see to it that you pay dearly for this."

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:37.250
Please allow me to pay you a reward.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.750
She says she's really happy
that you're satisfied.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:48.460
Uh, are you sure you translated
everything correctly?

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:51.380
Well... some of the grammar
might have been off.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:53.750
Oh, madam!

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:54.710
Hands off!

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:56.330
THWACK!

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:58.630
Mumble, mumble, mumble...

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:04.960
YOUNG MASTER!

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:06.960
THE MATRON OF THE HOUSE SAYS

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:10.290
SHE DOESN'T RECALL RAISING YOU
TO BE SUCH A CRASS WISECRACKER!

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:12.540
Cracker... cracker... cracker...

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:13.880
Wahoo!

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:15.380
I got to say my line! Nobody interu-

00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:16.710
KNOCK IT OFF!

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:25.420
Wait, Mother! Just calm down! Please!

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:28.960
She's asking what this is supposed to mean.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:32.130
Throwing a glove like that
can only mean one thing...

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:34.000
she's proposing a duel!

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:42.880
CREEP

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:40.500
How dreadful.

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:42.880
This has turned into
quite a royal mess, hasn't it?

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:44.710
You never know with the Mendo family,

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:48.790
CREEP

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:46.630
they could pull out any kind
of crazy weapon!

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:48.790
Yeah, but don't forget
they're fighting an ALIEN!

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:53.000
"Please, madam! You have to reconsider!"

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:57.630
"Think about the impact it would have
on our precious families!

00:07:57.630 --> 00:07:59.130
It's just too much!"

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:00.540
Listen to reason, Mother!

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.540
This is hardly worth getting into a duel over!

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.580
"Very well. We'll just have to settle this."

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:08.540
"To be frank..."

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:13.960
"I'm both honored and overjoyed that you
would have your own son propose to me...

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:17.080
but I will have to refrain
from marrying him."

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:18.000
WHOMP!

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:21.000
It wasn't that kind of "proposal"...

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.330
Mumble, mumble, mumble...

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:23.670
Yes, of course.

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:25.750
You should go home and rest.

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.250
Oh my! Is class finished already?

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.880
Mama! Let's go home!

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:38.130
There are parent-teacher conferences
being held in the afternoon...

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:41.500
I have to attend those at the very least.

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:56.540
I guess... my fever must be...
worse than I thought...

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:02.210
Ouch!

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:03.710
C'mon, it's time to go.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.750
Whew! I'm so glad that Ataru
didn't do anything stupid!

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.080
Huh?

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.080
Is this all the screentime that I ge-

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.000
Top of the morning!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:28.380
Rise and shine, sleepyhead!

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:31.210
You're going to have to skip
breakfast again if you don't get up!

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:33.540
Then you'll be hungry all day!

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.040
Just 5 more minutes...

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.080
Jeez.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:41.210
Darling...

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:45.880
WAKE YOUR BUTT UP THIS INSTANT!

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:49.790
I have to say,

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:53.290
it is such a big help when you get
this lazy bum out of bed, Lum.

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:56.500
He used to be late to school
almost every day, you know.

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:58.170
Well, that's what a wife does!

00:09:58.170 --> 00:10:00.330
Ataru really doesn't deserve you.

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.250
That's for sure.

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:03.540
Man, I can't even sleep in anymore!

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:06.500
Ataru! Stop sticking so close to Lum!

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.830
Shaddup! Lum's the one sticking to me!

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.330
Good morning, Lum!

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:11.500
Morning!

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.040
Good morning!

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:17.580
Huh?

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:21.330
Is this a leaf? The color looks all weird.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:23.040
That's a maple leaf.

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:25.290
Why are the colors different?

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:29.040
Well, because it's fall.
All the leaves on these trees turn red.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.330
It's a beautiful sight.

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:32.500
Really? Wow, I can't wait to see it!

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:34.960
You'll probably be able to see them next week.

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:41.380
Hey there, cutie! What class are you in?

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:43.080
Hook me up with your digits
and your address!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:44.250
Darling!

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:45.040
Quit trying to cheat on me!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.630
And there they go again.
Quit trying to cheat on me!

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:48.080
The same old routine.
Quit trying to cheat on me!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:48.710
Quit trying to cheat on me!

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:51.330
Since Your Parting

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.330
Get a load of this.

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:56.250
That's really cool, Moroboshi!

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:57.830
You're so talented!

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:02.790
Look, Lum is sewing!

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:05.420
Miss Lum. May I ask what you're making?

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:07.250
A present for my darling.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:08.710
For Moroboshi?

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:10.000
Now for my special trick!

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:10.960
Double!

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:11.830
Incredible!

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.290
Show us more!

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:15.540
Go on a date with me and I will!

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:15.750
Ataru's just never gonna learn, is he?

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:17.290
Oh, then never mind.
Ataru's just never gonna learn, is he?

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:18.130
Don't be like that!
Ataru's just never gonna learn, is he?

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:20.250
Who tries to pick up chick with yo-yos?

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:23.040
Whatever, man, this is the kinda stuff
that I wanna do at my age!

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:24.630
Keep at it.

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:27.250
Sooner or later even Miss Lum
will want nothing to do with you.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:29.380
Like I give a crap!

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:32.000
Is that so?

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.380
Uh oh, here comes the electricity!

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:37.670
Actually...

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:40.250
I'm worried about you, darling.

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:41.710
Huh?

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:44.460
Because whenever I'm not watching,

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:47.250
you always do the most stupidest things.

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:48.880
Where is this coming from all of a sudden?!

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:52.330
If I may, Miss Lum, he does incredibly
stupid things even when you are watching.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:53.540
Yeah, I guess you're right.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:55.920
I'm too scared of Lum
to be doing anything stupid!

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:57.130
He sounds proud of it...

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:58.290
Shinobu!

00:11:58.420 --> 00:12:00.170
Look! Isn't this super cool?

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:02.250
Come on, Mendo.
Let's go somewhere else.

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:03.830
Wait a second! Just watch!

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:05.960
I can do three at once! See?!

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:11.130
It's done!

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:16.380
Darling!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.670
Make sure you get up on time
in the morning, okay?

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:19.580
Starting tomorrow, I'll be...

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:21.210
Whatever, just leave me alone!

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:22.750
Don't be ridiculous!

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.750
I'm being a caring wife, darling!

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:27.130
Is that what you call the violent
wake up call I get every morning?

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:29.080
And the electric shocks
I get on the way to school?!

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:31.380
Put yourself in my shoes for a damn minute!

00:12:31.380 --> 00:12:32.750
You're a huge pain in the ass!

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:40.790
Good grief! What I wouldn't give
to go back to being free and single!

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:44.290
Oh, did you finish it?

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:46.170
I was curious about that. Let me see.

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:47.170
No way!

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:48.710
C'mon, what's the big deal?

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:50.830
You clearly don't appreciate
what I bring to this relationship,

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:52.040
so just leave me alone!

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:54.290
Huh?! Give me freakin' break!

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.920
One minute you're up in my face
and the next you want me gone!

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.790
Just how self-centered can you get?

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:00.040
Ugh! Screw this!

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:08.210
Darling? Listen, I...

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:09.210
Goodnight!

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.080
Darling...

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:28.080
Bye-bye.

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:33.210
Bye-bye!

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:42.040
Moroboshi

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:42.420
Ataru! Ataru!

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:48.920
You're already running late!
Get downstairs right now!

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:51.580
Argh, ouch...

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:53.080
Huh? Where's Lum?

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:54.380
On the double, mister!

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:55.380
Crap!

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:01.420
Hey, Ataru, where is Lum?

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:04.580
Let me guess. Did she finally run out
of patience and dump your sorry butt?

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:05.500
Gotta go!

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:11.080
Made it in time!

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:12.540
Sup?

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:13.330
Yo.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:15.170
Moroboshi! Where's Miss Lum?

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:16.580
She isn't here already?

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:19.040
That's weird, you two always come together.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:22.380
Well, how about that?
Lum must have overslept!

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:24.330
And after busting my chops so hard.

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:26.130
Now she must be ashamed to even show up.

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:27.960
Now's my chance!

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.460
I can pick up all the chicks I want!

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:33.000
Jeez, always so full of himself.

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:35.540
Moroboshi

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:35.540
I'm home!

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:36.830
Welcome back.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.500
Was Lum at school today?

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.460
Nope. I haven't seen her.

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:43.580
Oh dear. Does that mean
she won't be joining us for dinner?

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:06.960
Bye-bye.

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:14.880
Moroboshi

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:15.130
Ataru! Ataru!

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:27.040
Good morning, Moroboshi.

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.250
Morning!

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:29.250
Yo.

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:32.630
He's not his usual self.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:39.500
Hey, Ataru.
Is Lum staying home again today?

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:40.420
Beats me.

00:15:40.420 --> 00:15:43.040
This is the third day!
Is she all right or what?

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.210
What's that thing?

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.210
Hey!

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:47.380
Is this a Lum doll?

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.420
Dude! Give it back!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.210
Only if you let me pay Lum a visit!

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:51.040
Moroboshi.

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.960
I'm willing to bet that Miss Lum...

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:55.790
has dumped you.

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:58.750
What on earth makes you say that?!

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:00.080
Just a gut feeling.

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.290
I tend to pick up on these things.

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:06.000
Anyway, it's totally baffling to me
that she didn't do it ages ago.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:08.670
Okay, smartass, what are you trying to imply?

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:15.630
Money Defines The Man

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:14.040
Life must be hard
with a doofus for a husband.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:15.630
I'm well aware.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:18.580
The Mendo Conglomerate
could easily pull some strings

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:18.290
Money

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.170
and get your husband into
a top-class university, you know.

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.420
However...

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:23.250
Sparkle

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:27.210
you'll have to abandon him and
spend your life with me instead, baby!

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:29.000
But I'm a married woman!

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.460
Think it over carefully!

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:34.500
Your answer will decide how bright
your husband's future is!

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:37.790
Ahhh! What a pickle!

00:16:34.710 --> 00:16:36.880
Money Defines The Man

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:40.670
Enough of this bullcrap...

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:43.250
I KNOW YOU KIDNAPPED LUM,
YOU JERKFACE!

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.210
DON'T SNAP AT ME FOR NO REASON,
YOU IDIOT!

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:46.880
Give Lum back!

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:47.830
I want her back!

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:49.130
RIGHT NOW!

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:51.750
And why the hell would I have any idea
where Miss Lum is?!

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:55.210
You seriously don't know?

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:58.130
H-hold on! Has Miss Lum disappeared?

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:02.130
Yeah. She's gone missing.

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:03.210
What?!

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:05.920
WHY DIDN'T YOU SAY THAT
IN THE FIRST PLACE!

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:10.830
Just let the Mendo Private
Police Force handle this!

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:16.710
Listen up, men!

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:18.670
This is a matter of Mendo family pride!

00:17:18.670 --> 00:17:20.000
Don't let the grass grow under your feet!

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.170
Move quickly and find Miss Lum!

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:23.330
Roger!

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:29.460
WHO THE HELL TOLD YOU TO CUT THE GRASS?!

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:31.330
We're not letting it grow under our feet, sir!

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:33.880
Miss Lum! Where are you?

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:35.250
No sign of her!

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:36.710
No sign of her!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.130
No sign of her!

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:40.460
LOOK SOMEWHERE SHE MIGHT
ACTUALLY BE, DAMMIT!

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:42.040
Hey! Are you there, Lum?

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.130
Come out, Lum!
Hey! Are you there, Lum?

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:44.080
Come out, Lum!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:45.790
She's not around here.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:47.710
Maybe she finally decided that
Ataru was hopeless

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.790
and went back to her home planet.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:56.080
No way... that can't be...

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:58.630
I refuse to believe it!

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:16.420
Bank Robber

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:16.420
Apprehended Again

00:18:50.460 --> 00:18:51.420
Lum...

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:55.500
Say it ain't so...

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:02.250
Ya dummy!

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:04.250
This is where ya gotta leave your official seal.

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:06.460
Ugh! How long is this going to take?!

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:08.380
It's such a major headache!

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.580
Ya have to renew your passport, sweetie.

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.420
Otherwise ya can't stay on Earth.

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:13.920
Think about it, Lum.

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:15.790
Isn't it about time ya came home to us?

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:18.080
I'm happy by my darling's side, thank you!

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:20.500
Are the two of ya really living the good life?

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:21.920
We sure are!

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:23.460
I find that hard to believe!

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:24.920
Settle down, honey.

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:27.750
Bwah! What in blazes?!

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:30.630
Dad! You're not supposed to touch that!

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:36.000
Leaving me nothing but this doll...

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:41.460
That stupid Lum!

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:45.500
How could she just go home
without saying anything to me?!

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:56.750
It's awfully mean to rig the doll
with a microphone like that...

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:59.460
I was just worried about
what would happen while I'm gone.

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:01.540
This is ruining the mood. Turn it off.

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:02.420
Nuh-uh!

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.250
Leave it be...

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:27.630
Darling!

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:38.080
Lum...

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:48.880
I've come back home!

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:57.580
S-shucks, you're back again.

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:00.170
I felt like I had new
lease on life after you left.

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:01.670
Guess that's over now.

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:02.920
What a bummer!

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:09.750
Oh hey. You're carrying my doll.

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:11.710
Looks like it got pretty dirty!

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:13.040
Wh-whatever! Who cares!

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:24.880
Denpa tenpo up shite zessan kandenchuu!

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:38.080
Anata ni mo wasuretai koto
kanashii koto aru no kashira ne

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:44.830
Shiranai eiga nano ni namida o nagasu no wa
dramatic ga tariteinai kara yo

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:52.000
Sonna gu ni mo tsukanai koto
kudaranai koto kangaete bakari ne

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:58.750
Ame ga agareba ai mo sono yokogao mo
dareka no mono ni naru no deshou

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:03.170
Usoppachi no foundation mo zenbu konya no tame

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:06.500
Nano ni ittai zentai doushite doushite naze naze hatena

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:10.040
Fuantei na kantera doko made iku no

00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:13.000
Anata issaigassai hourisatte mou

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:15.130
Joudan ja nai nai wa!

00:22:15.130 --> 00:22:16.960
Tokyo Shandy Rendezvous

00:22:16.960 --> 00:22:20.500
Sono toki ga kitatte dounimo naranai ze

00:22:20.830 --> 00:22:25.000
Aimai na hontou nante melancholy ka suru dake

00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:27.830
Atashi o saa kassaratte ima take on me

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:31.000
Tokyo Shandy Rendezvous

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:34.420
Sono toki ga kitatte dounimo naranai ze

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:39.080
Aimai na hontou nante melancholy ka suru dake

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:42.460
Atashi o saa kassaratte ima take on me yes

00:22:47.000 --> 00:22:51.920
Mendo Siblings!!

00:22:47.000 --> 00:22:51.920
A Strange New Year at the Mendo Estate

00:22:47.210 --> 00:22:49.000
On the next episode of Urusei Yatsura.

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:51.580
If you must know, we are engaged.
